<title>USA: CCB Financial won't comment on stock price.</title>
<headline>CCB Financial won't comment on stock price.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, N.C. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CCB Financial Corp Wedneday declined comment on its stock rising more than four points on the day.</p>
<p>Ths stock closed at 69-5/8 Wednesday, up 4-1/8.</p>
<p>President and Chief Executive E.C. Roessler said in a statement that it is the company's policy &quot;not to comment on large price movements in our stock.&quot;</p>
<p>A company spokesman did not immediately return a telephone call.</p>
</text>
